      "status": "reviewed",
      "rationale": "A real photograph of a hand holding a blue phone fills the first phone screen, with an Open until 8 p.m. chip, the Bell, Virgin Plus and Lucky Mobile logos on a white plate along its foot, then the headline 'Pick up a phone. Ask a real person.' and the Call button. One look answers who, where, open now and what they sell. On a desktop the headline and photo sit side by side. The photo itself is a generic stock phone in a hand, and the header (tagline plus two rows of pills) takes a quarter of the first phone screen.",
